WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:06.610
<i>The Love Ritual is a holy ritual performed 
to give birth to a Star Child.</i>

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.240
<i>In order to aid the Visitor, 
the maidens of the 12 constellations</i>

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.120
<i>aid the creation of Star Children...</i>

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.280
It's done!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.110
Mahiru...

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:15.610
Itsuki...

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.610
He's born!

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:32.590
Congratulations.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.240
He's born?

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.120
But I...

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.960
I haven't...

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.760
What?

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.210
The Love Ritual is not a sexual act.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:44.300
Bonding with the maidens 
through physical contact

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.860
gives birth to the Star Child, 
as emotional feelings are heightened.

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.470
I don't know what Mana told you,

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.780
but it <i>is</i> a holy ritual.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.510
Please remember that.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:57.160
Darn.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.030
Here, this is a Star Child.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.220
Nice to meet you, Visitor-sama.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.660
I'm Virgo, and I represent the 
constellation of the Maiden!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.380
Virgo, huh?

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:09.980
Please grow into a powerful
 warrior and aid Itsuki.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:10.860
I will!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.040
He's so cute!

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.510
He's our...

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.060
Thank you, Mahiru.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.650
G-Good morning.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.880
Good morning.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:58.260
Yesterday was... uh...

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.650
Y-Yeah...

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:05.560
Impressive! I'm starting to smell 
the sweet scent of a ripe fruit!

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.490
Hehehe!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:09.230
It's all thanks to the Love Ritual!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.660
Well done, Itsuki!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.790
To be accurate, I haven't done 
it all the way to the end.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.720
Come on, how can that be?

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.760
Check out how voluptuous 
her boobs have become!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.230
Hey...

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.360
You sure enjoyed them 
last night, didn't you?

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.800
You perverted raccoon!

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:27.960
By the way, what happened to the 
Star Child that was born last night?

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.060
I sent him off to a foster home.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.790
Huh? How come?

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.060
Can't he live with us?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.100
Unlike the fruit of love between you two,

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.990
the Star Child is a warrior 
born with a mission.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:42.750
He has to become strong in order 
to fight alongside the Visitor.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.400
Otherwise, he'll get beaten 
up by the Impurities.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.860
Is that how it is?

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.240
Can we go see him?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.790
Of course!

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:55.200
But you two still have many things 
to do as the Visitor and a maiden.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.750
Oh, you're right.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.690
We can't go back unless 
we save the world, right?

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:01.110
Let's go!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.010
Wait a minute!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.140
Stop for a second around that corner!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.390
And... action!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:15.900
I'm late, I'm late.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.250
What's your problem?

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.900
Huh? Oh, sorry.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.370
Geez, give that back.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.890
I'm late, I'm late.

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:35.180
Why do I have to do this?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.880
What's with this act?

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:38.880
She's not in a hurry at all.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.140
Good morning.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.890
I was waiting for you two.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.760
Let me introduce the other maidens first.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:53.520
I see you're all here!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:57.720
This is a special class just for the 
maidens of the 12 constellations.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:00.270
Mahiru will be joining as well.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.280
Please introduce yourself, Itsuki.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.110
Um...

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.120
My name is Yuge Itsuki.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.690
Nice to meet you.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.390
I'm Konatsuki Mahiru.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.460
Nice to meet you.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.540
Everyone, please introduce yourselves.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.420
I'm Arie.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:17.370
I'm Maiden of Aries.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.670
I devote myself to the church.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.920
My name's Tarua!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.660
I'm Maiden of Taurus!

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.770
I usually work as a delivery girl!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:26.680
Nice to meet ya!

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.360
I'm Lillith, a fortune teller.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.430
I'm Maiden of Geminiー

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.920
Ow! Mana, did you just 
randomly hit me again?!

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.940
Her personality changes like 
this when you give her a jolt.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.440
I'm Ruka. Maiden of Cancer.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.360
<i>She's the one I met this morning.</i>

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:46.110
You don't have to remember 
my name or anything.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.650
My name is Femiruna.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:52.400
I'm Maiden of Leo.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.380
Now that I've been chosen 
as one of the maidens,

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.120
world peace is practically guaranteed.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.480
I'm Maiden of Libra, Mirei.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.110
I mainly research magic.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.000
That is all.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:06.250
I'm Sue. Maiden of Sagittarius.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:10.510
My job is taking care of animals, 
and I like cuddling them.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.120
I'm Farun!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.880
I somehow became Maiden of Capricorn.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:18.770
I'm an adventurer, 
but I'm working at a bar now!

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.080
I'm Collette, a baker!

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.120
I now serve as Maiden of Aquarius.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.780
Onii-san, please come buy bread that I bake!

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:32.510
Uh, I'm... Um... Yuzuha.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:35.360
I usually draw paintings at home.

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.500
I may be Maiden of Pisces.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:43.240
Then there's the Maiden of Virgo, Mahiru,
 and I'm the Maiden of Scorpio.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.920
We are the maidens of the 12 constellations.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:50.240
And I'm Mana, a maiden born 
under the constellation of Lewd.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.890
I like the lewd side of you.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.760
Geez, you're such a player!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.250
By the way, Itsuki,

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:59.560
You will perform the ritual 
with all the girls over there.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.580
Do you know how to seduce them?

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.770
No, my level is pretty low in that.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.770
Read this and learn.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:09.230
It's a present from me. An autographed copy!

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:11.280
It'll teach you proper behavior for an adult!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.780
That sounds amazing, in many ways.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.940
Read it and learn manners and etiquette.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.700
An example lesson for beginners:

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.450
"Don't turn off: lights in the room
 and fire in the crotch!"

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.870
"One phrase for emergencies: 
we'll come together."

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.290
Say it, come on!

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.050
We'll come together...

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.480
Very good!

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:31.560
After all, the maidens are all virgins 
so it's easy as pie.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:32.590
You're right!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.550
I'm starting to think reading 
it will help me level up!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:37.690
If you can form strong 
bonds with the maidens,

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.460
then you can give birth to stronger, 
more powerful Star Children.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:44.360
Exhilarating skinship may 
be necessary at times!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.070
For the sake of saving the world.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:52.570
<i>And so, my life at Granvania began.</i>

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:57.520
I did as you instructed, 
but what was the purpose?

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.240
According to my manual,

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:03.210
that is the #1 ranked 
fateful encounter in Sola.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.940
We're doing all this so that Itsuki 
can create a powerful Star Child.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.330
How are you two doing?

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.570
Are you getting accustomed 
to living in this world?

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:13.960
I guess I'm starting to.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.370
What about business?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:17.470
Itsuki, are you making Star Children?

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.220
No, not at all.

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.760
Man, he's so useless.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:27.230
Oh! I hear there's an event called cherry 
blossom viewing in your world, Sola.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.690
We have decided to cancel the class,

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.990
and have a cherry blossom viewing today.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:36.490
Let's have fun today, as a welcome 
party for Itsuki and Mahiru.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.490
Cheers!

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:41.930
Please eat to your heart's content, everyone.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:43.500
Yay! Let's dig in!

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:47.400
Hey, grab me some fried chicken!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.500
Oh, I'm sorry for the disturbance.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.540
Wow, these chocolates are really good!

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:55.260
You're right!

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:57.660
Femiruna brought these for us.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.950
I can taste a hint of brandy.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:01.580
Very similar to bonbons.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:06.170
I'm not too sure, but we receive 
many gifts intended for my father.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:08.170
I just randomly picked one.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:11.210
No wonder, since your family is 
the wealthiest in Granvania.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.480
That's a lot.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.620
That's a cute chicken!

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.860
His name is Quelquelle.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.120
Erm... Can you pass me some bread?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:20.870
Um...

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.230
Do you want some bread, Yuzuha?

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.780
I baked it myself!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:25.870
Here you go!

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.750
Thank you.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.700
Huh? Where's Ruka?

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:32.730
She was here just now.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.760
I'll go look for her.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:39.980
What's the matter, Ruka?

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:42.960
Oh, it's just you.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:45.320
I want to bring some flowers home.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.810
Yeah, these are pretty.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:51.610
I work at an orphanage.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.730
I think the kids will like them.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.490
I'll help you out.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.240
T-Thanks.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.380
R-Ruka?

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.280
You're too close...

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.190
What?

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:17.000
Are you thinking of something so 
dirty that I can't even get close to you?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.300
You can try to hide it, 
but I see through everything.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.140
I'm an esper!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.140
What did you say?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.140
I have celestial powers.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.900
I can read your mind.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:30.900
Really?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:34.300
That's right. You can be gentle,

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.640
but all men have dirty 
thoughts in their minds.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.100
They're always like that.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.530
Don't go deciding that on your own.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:45.600
Really? Then let me read your mind now.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.240
If you're thinking of something 
even slightly inappropriate,

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:51.020
you can forget about me 
performing the ritual with you!

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:52.000
The ritual?

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.990
Well, I'm talking about the Love Ritual!

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:58.800
I'll be revealing a lot for the ritual, too.

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:00.350
Do as you like.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.970
All right, then I won't hold back.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.500
Why can't I read your mind?!

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.360
Is that head of yours empty?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.690
How can that be?

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:17.880
Right, you're not from Granvania, 
so maybe I can't read your mind.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.630
Are you satisfied now?

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:20.950
I guess.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.540
I can understand that you maidens 
are nervous about this..

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:27.450
I'll try my best to talk 
about what I really feel.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.280
I'll get going soon.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:34.680
Thanks for helping.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.030
Huh? Itsuki?

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.390
What's the matter, Mahiru?

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.530
I feel hot inside.

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.020
Did you drink alcohol?!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.090
Of course not!

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.420
You dummy!

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:54.770
Those chocolates?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.650
I just savored an adult-flavored chocolate!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:02.030
They're the perfect sweets 
for an adult like me!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:06.360
Are the bonbons in Granvania 
too strong for people of Sola?

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:10.310
I wanted to give you proper thanks.

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:16.060
Remember when we were little, 
and you saved me

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:18.120
when those bullies were waiting for me?

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:24.140
It reminded me of that time when 
you defeated the Impurity.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.090
Did I do something like that?

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:29.240
Oh, I know you're blushing!

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:37.680
Then... do you remember the promise 
you made when we were in elementary school?

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:38.570
The promise?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.830
10 years ago, during the autumn festival.

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.260
I'm sorry. I don't remember.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.670
Well, I had a feeling you didn't!

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.080
Mahiru, are you angry?

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.340
Not really.

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:58.540
It would be troublesome if 
you did remembered.

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.720
We have to get back to the others.

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.050
Come on, let's get going!

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:08.000
Your mission is to produce 
strong Star Children, right?

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.840
Make sure to get along 
with the other maidens, too.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.040
<i>A promise from 10 years ago?</i>

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:30.010
I went through all the trouble to 
set up the cherry blossom viewing.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:32.030
You still can't produce another Star Child?

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:32.990
Yeah.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.060
You're hopeless.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.040
Follow me.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.040
You'll need to prepare 
for the labyrinth soon.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:45.160
Just looking at these weapons turns 
you on to the max, doesn't it?

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.380
Huh? Huh? You want me to stop?

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.850
Don't... stop...

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.160
You sure? You sure?

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.470
I'm all hard now!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.780
Stop messing around!

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:56.810
Don't underestimate the labyrinth!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:00.310
Itsuki, it's a really dangerous place 
where your life will be in danger.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.320
Many warriors have fought the 
Impurities and never returned.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:07.640
You'll figure out soon enough
why I'm going such lengths

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.570
for the Love Rituals.

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.950
This is the foster home.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.080
You'll find your Star Child here.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.080
Wanna go see him?

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.080
Don't play around!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.580
You think you can defeat
 the Impurity Lord like that?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.590
Aren't you embarrassed, Virgo?!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.270
Oh, I see you're at it.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.460
Oh!

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:35.350
Hello, Visitor-sama.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.850
Did her character just switch?

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:41.040
I train Star Children at the foster home.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.060
My name is Alfie!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.180
Hey, Itsuki!

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:47.360
You're only allowed to ogle at maidens!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.110
Sorry, I couldn't help it.

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:53.770
Virgo, Visitor-sama has come to see you.

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:56.120
Visitor-sama!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:03.250
I'll work hard to become strong so 
I can enter the labyrinth with you!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.100
Okay, train hard.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.860
Um, Visitor-sama.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:07.760
Call me Itsuki.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.320
Itsuki-san, you have to 
produce more Star Children,

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:15.260
or the battle in the labyrinth 
will be very difficult.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.000
She's right.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:20.300
You have to perform Love Rituals and 
make more Star Children,

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:21.770
before the king orders you to go.

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:26.620
But aside from Mahiru, I don't 
really know the other girls.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:30.810
Haven't you had a fateful encounter, 
or someone who made an impression on you?

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:33.030
Ru-something, or something and such?

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:37.540
Hey, wait!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.550
There, there, it doesn't hurt anymore.

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:53.860
Did that take you by surprise?

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:55.340
It's all right now.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:56.820
Don't worry.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.150
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.280
I know.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:20.410
Can you... um... give birth to my Star Child?

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:24.920
Well, I knew this day would come, but...

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.040
I might have to head out 
for the labyrinth soon.

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:32.120
I don't mind, but there's only one 
Star Child that can go with me right now.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.840
I thought he'd be lonely.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.530
There's only one?

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:39.100
Yeah. If there was at least one more...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.030
I think it'd be more reassuring for him.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:47.610
I can't read your mind, 
but it doesn't sound like you're lying.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:52.960
I also wouldn't want a Star Child to suffer.

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.320
You must really like kids.

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.450
Yes.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:59.150
I want to get close to them.

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:04.040
I work with kids because I want 
to do what I can to help out.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.000
But...

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:10.160
If a maiden and the Visitor communicate 
heart to heart and perform the Love Ritual,

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.820
then a strong Star Child will be born, right?

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:13.920
Yes.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:18.860
If we're going to give birth to one, 
then I hope it'll be strong and cute!

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:21.980
Having a baby is a miracle.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.930
You're really kind.

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:27.630
It's necessary to save the world, too.

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:29.360
Thank you, Ruka.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.610
So, where do we start?

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:35.190
I did read the book to learn 
the etiquette, but...

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:46.790
Wait! At least turn off the lights...

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.140
"Don't turn off: lights in the room 
and fire in the crotch!"

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.420
That's what was written in the book.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:56.190
No fair. I'm the only one 
whose heart is pounding.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.550
I feel so silly.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.260
I'm nervous, too.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:05.180
Don't you have a line that'll lighten up 
the mood for a situation like this?

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:09.190
We'll come together.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.710
Huh?!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:17.920
Midnight tonight, someone will be born.

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:20.490
All thanks to me!

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:26.240
The fate of this world rests in your hands.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.460
I'm counting on you.

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:28.830
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:33.420
Itsuki, I will now bestow upon you 
Star Wards for the 12 constellations.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.760
These are the Star Wards?

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:44.220
Star Wards are special things 
created by the maidens.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.190
There are 12 of them, 
just like the constellations,

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:47.980
and they have the power
 to absorb Impurities!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.310
Learn more at the website!

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:53.120
If you release the 12 Star Wards as offerings

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.080
at the deepest layers of 
the Stardust Labyrinth,

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.910
the Impurities will be sealed,

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:59.820
and your mission as Visitor
 will be accomplished.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.220
I understand.

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:05.270
Allow me to guide you to 
the labyrinth's entrance.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.480
The power of the maidens of the 
12 constellations is needed

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.250
to open the Stardust Labyrinth's entrance.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:16.520
This gate is the entrance for the 
labyrinth, prepared for the Visitor.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:21.480
The labyrinth was built by Mirei's 
ancestors to seal the Impurities.

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:24.780
We will now commence the 
Ritual of Star Wards

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:26.680
for the sealed gate of the Stardust Labyrinth.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.440
Incredible.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.490
Please be careful.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.230
I will!

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:46.950
We're counting on you, Itsuki.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.330
Right. Let's go.

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:50.830
Yes!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:54.400
I'll come along as a guide for today.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.340
It's good manners to be 
gentle for the first time!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.840
It's like a maze. I don't 
know which way to go.

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:10.240
The Stardust Labyrinth has 12 separate bottom 
layers, dedicated to each constellation.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.270
Think of it like this.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.960
And an Impurity Lord awaits 
at each bottom layer.

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.930
You can think of them as the final boss.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:18.820
Are they strong?

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.120
Obviously.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:24.650
Impurities are made from negative energy 
formed by human interactions,

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:27.660
and within the labyrinth they 
have become quite strong

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:29.830
through amalgamation and synthesis.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.530
But worry not!

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:35.680
You have your Star Children with you!

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.750
Star Children! Defeat the Impurity!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:38.750
Got it!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.600
Yeah, that's the wayー

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.760
Th-There it is!

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.310
You're holding it upside down!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.350
Don't jump the gun!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.100
Are you all right?

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.780
I'll protect you!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.290
Virgo! Cancer!

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.980
No way...

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.400
Itsuki, they're both down.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:31.760
We have to turn back.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.310
Just run for now!

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:44.080
Now I understand what you said before.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:46.240
I can't protect anyone like this.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.670
There's a limit to what I can do on my own.

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.970
I need stronger Star Children!

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:59.210
<i>I'll make them have my children!</i>

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.000
<b>I Want You to Have My Child</b>

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:40.020
Would You Try Having My Child?

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:40.020
Granvania Dream.
